    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CENSUS OF 2000&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Census of 2000 is a specific event providing detailed demographic data for the city."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0473-a2a2380670e9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOWN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Town is another location where demographic statistics are provided, similar to the city."&lt;SEP&gt;"town refers to the geographical area where the population statistics are collected."</data>
